OL,3,GNEWSAAI helping speed up bus pass
OL,4,Aapplications says council
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtificial intelligence (AI) is being
OL,7,Fused to help speed up bus pass
OL,8,Fapplications in Worcestershire.
OL,10,FThe Bus Pass AI Agent has helped
OL,11,Fprocess 2,500 applications and checked
OL,12,F7,500 uploaded documents at
OL,13,FWorcestershire County Council in eight
OL,14,Fmonths.
OL,16,FThe council said using the technology
OL,17,Fhas helped free up staff time to focus
OL,18,Fon supporting residents while human
OL,19,Foversight does remain in place.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
