OL,3,GNEWSAAI helping speed up bus pass
OL,4,Aapplications says council
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the system found hundreds of
OL,7,Fissues that could have delayed
OL,8,Fapplications and helped residents
OL,9,Fcorrect them earlier, reducing the need
OL,10,Ffor repeated contact.
